To find the correct answer, we refer to the Mizoram Municipalities Act, 2007 (MMA 2007), specifically Section 25(2) which deals with the constitution of a Joint Committee.

According to Section 25(2) of the Mizoram Municipalities Act, 2007, a Joint Committee shall consist of:
1. Two nominees of each constituent Municipality or local authority;
2. One nominee of each of the concerned Departments of the State Government or of the concerned authorities;
3. Such expert or experts as the State Government may nominate;
4. The Director of Local Bodies (or the officer-in-charge of municipal administration) who shall also act as the convener of the Committee.

All four statements (1, 2, 3, and 4) are correct and constitute the members of the Joint Committee under this section.

Therefore, the correct option is B (1, 2, 3 & 4 are the correct answer).

[ANSWER: B]
